\p \v 15 \w [Aaron] shall then slaughter|strong="H07819"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the goat|strong="H08163"\w* \w for the sin offering|strong="H02403"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w for the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w and bring|strong="H00935"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w its blood|strong="H01818"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w behind|strong="H01004"\w* \w the veil|strong="H06532"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H00854"\w* \w and with its blood|strong="H01818"\w* \w he must do|strong="H06213"\w* \w as|strong="H00834"\w* \w he did|strong="H06213"\w* \w with the bull’s|strong="H06499"\w* \w blood|strong="H01818"\w*: \w He is to sprinkle|strong="H05137"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w it against|strong="H05921"\w* \w the mercy seat|strong="H03727"\w* \w and in front|strong="H06440"\w* \w of it|strong="H03727"\w*.
