\s1 The Law of Redemption
\p \v 23 \w The land|strong="H00776"\w* \w must not|strong="H03808"\w* \w be sold|strong="H04376"\w* \w permanently|strong="H06783"\w*, \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w [it]|strong="H00776"\w* [is] Mine, \w and|strong="H03588"\w* \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w are but foreigners|strong="H01616"\w* \w and residents|strong="H08453"\w* \w with Me|strong="H05978"\w*. \v 24 \w Thus for every|strong="H03605"\w* \w piece of property|strong="H00776"\w* \w you possess|strong="H00272"\w*, \w you must provide for|strong="H05414"\w* \w the redemption|strong="H01353"\w* \w of the land|strong="H00776"\w*.
